1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,643
C, iron three chloride.

2
00:00:02,643 --> 00:00:12,356
The iron three over iron two couple, plus zero point seven seven volts, lies above copper, so iron three ions oxidise copper.

3
00:00:12,356 --> 00:00:21,744
Dilute hydrochloric and sulphuric acids cannot, since copper is below hydrogen, and zinc ions are far too weak an oxidant.

